;
; TEXTEDIT on an ATTDEF and on an INSERT with attributes ([0.8.1-RT11], work #939;
; card PT11, point 2; ADR 0054, point 6; ADR 0056, point 4).
; attributi.dxf is written by hand, with the header and tables of
; insert/file-e-uguale/destinazione.dxf ($HANDSEED 1000, no DIMSTYLE table):
; - block COMP (record 40, BLOCK 41, ENDBLK 45): a LINE 42 from 0,0 to 20,0 and two
;   ATTDEF without modes, 43 CODICE (prompt "Codice", default "A100") at 0,5 and
;   44 SIGLA (prompt "Sigla", default "K1") at 0,10, height 2.5;
; - in the drawing: ATTDEF 100 NOTA (prompt "Nota", default "Testo") at 0,0, height
;   2.5; INSERT 101 of COMP at 50,0 with ATTRIB 102 CODICE = "A100" at 50,5 and
;   ATTRIB 103 SIGLA = "K1" at 50,10, then SEQEND 104.
; The ATTDEF asks tag, prompt and default value; Enter keeps the prompt. The INSERT asks
; "<tag> <value>:" for each attribute, in order; Enter keeps CODICE. Each object is a
; Textedit step. The INSERT is chosen on its line (60,0), more than 3 from the
; attribute boxes; the ATTDEF inside its box (1,1).
; ~box: Liberation Sans 2.1.5 advances read with fontTools, cap height 1409, ascent
; 1854, descent -434, height 2.5. An ATTDEF shows its tag (dxf-blocchi/
; attributi-extra-seqend): AVVISO (A 1366, V 1366, V 1366, I 569, S 1366, O 1593:
; 7626 units) 13.530872959545777; CODICE (C 1479, O 1593, D 1479, I 569, C 1479,
; E 1366: 7965) 14.13236337828247; SIGLA (S 1366, I 569, G 1593, L 1139, A 1366: 6033)
; 10.704400283889283. ATTRIB values: A100 (1366 + 3 * 1139 = 4783) 8.48651525904897;
; K2 (1366 + 1139 = 2505) 4.444641589779984.
; The report after OPEN (drawing, dimension styles of the file without DIMSTYLE,
; blocks with units=4 from the record, documents) follows insert/file-e-uguale.
OPEN
attributi.dxf
TEXTEDIT
1,1
AVVISO

Nessuno
60,0

K2

